<title>USA: Microware inks Ericsson supply pact.</title>
<headline>Microware inks Ericsson supply pact.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microware Systems Corp said Monday it signed an agreement to supply its OS-9 real-time operating system for telecommunications equipment being developed by Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson of Sweden.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Microware said OS-9 provides the flexibility for a mobile telecommunications products providers to offer new services, such as Java-based applications, as they become available.</p>
<p>Microware develops operating system software.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading off 3/8 Monday at 12-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
